[quote]
The nightly dev build of the [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3692202776]Community Mod Framework (CMF)[/url].

[h1]Dev Build Notice:[/h1]
[list]
 [*] This is meant for other mods utilizing pre-release CMF features to test with.
 [*] You should not use the dev build unless you are specifically instructed to.
 [*] There will not be change notes on the dev version.
 [*] We will not offer support on the dev build (thus why comments are disabled).
 [*] It is automatically updated every night from the [url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/tree/dev]dev branch[/url] (if there are changes).
[/list]
[/quote]

